  "description": "Demolition of the existing rear extensions to the main building, outbuildings in the middle of the site and warehouse to the rear. Sub-division of the site and construction of ground, first and second floor rear extensions to the main building, installation of a rear dormer together with two roof-lights to the front roof slope to facilitate the creation of two self-contained flats (1 x 2-bed and 1 x 3-bed) (Use Class C3) with rear terraces at first and second floor levels.\r\nConstruction of a 3-storey building to the rear comprising three self-contained flats (2 x 2-bed and 1 x 3-bed) (Use Class C3) with rear terraces at ground and first floor levels. Works include hard and soft landscaping, provision of cycle parking, refuse and recycling storage.",
